---
description: Prevent invented product behavior and backend/auth drift
globs:
  - "**/*.kt"
  - "**/*.sql"
  - "**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/PRODUCT_REQUIREMENTS.md` and `docs/BACKEND_SUPABASE.md` when a task touches product behavior, profiles, messaging, backend, or data contracts.

Do not invent:
- authentication
- presence/online status
- member-since data
- read receipts
- unsupported profile fields
- arbitrary age rules
- new message states

If a requested UI requires data that does not exist, flag the mismatch instead of fabricating it.
